  "body": "Perched on the 5th floor of the Shoalhaven Apartments, this is one of the larger, premium layouts in the complex. Set on the quiet side with pleasant city outlooks, it delivers secure, low-maintenance living with every convenience right at your door. Designed for modern ease and priced to sell, this is Takapuna living at its very best.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n• Two spacious bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n• Additional modern family bathroom for daily convenience\r\n• Separate study/office for work or extra flexibility\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living flowing to a private balcony with dazzling CBD views.\r\n• Two secure undercover carparks\r\n• Lift access and secure entry\r\n• Residents’ swimming pool, pool house and landscaped communal gardens\r\n\r\nUnbeatable location:\r\n• Walk to Takapuna Beach, Shore City Mall, cafes, restaurants and Countdown\r\n• Close to Akoranga Bus Station, The Doctors medical centre and North Shore Hospital\r\n• Minutes to State Highway 1 for easy CBD and wider Auckland access\r\n• Zoned for top schools: Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls’ High and Takapuna Grammar\r\n\r\nThis is your chance to secure a premium apartment in the heart of Takapuna – act quickly before it’s gone.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note: Body Corp rules do not allow pets.",
